BECAUSE IN ORDER TO BE

00:09:14.654 --> 00:09:22.428 line:0%
ELECTABLE BASED ON ETHNICITY,

00:09:17.623 --> 00:09:22.728 line:0%
RELIGION, MY STRONG CONNECTION

