OR THE OTHER, WHICH BROUGHT US

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:32.538 line:0%
TO WHERE WE ARE, OUR STRUCTURE,

00:09:30.236 --> 00:09:33.706 line:0%
THE STRUCTURE OF CRIMINALITY,

00:09:32.705 --> 00:09:34.607 line:0%
THAT IS WHAT WE WANT TO

00:09:33.873 --> 00:09:36.642 line:0%
DISMANTLE NOW.

