AND ENSURE THAT THE NEXT

00:09:36.809 --> 00:09:42.515 line:0%
SELECTION IS BASED ON CHARACTER,

00:09:40.646 --> 00:09:44.483 line:0%
CAPACITY, COMPETENCE,

00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:44.850 line:0%
COMMITMENT TO DO THE RIGHT

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:55.428 line:0%
THING.

00:09:45.251 --> 00:10:03.436 line:0%
NIGERIA NOT JUST IN A PHYSICAL

00:09:55.595 --> 00:10:04.704 line:0%
MESS, IT IS AT THE LAST STAGE

00:10:04.403 --> 00:10:08.641 line:0%
TO COLLAPSE.

