THE PEOPLE IN THE NORTH DON'T

00:10:08.808 --> 00:10:14.513 line:0%
HAVE A SECURE PLACE, THEY DON'T

00:10:12.845 --> 00:10:18.618 line:0%
HAVE GOOD ROADS.

00:10:15.247 --> 00:10:21.520 line:0%
THEY DON'T HAVE --

00:10:19.251 --> 00:10:24.624 line:0%
PEOPLE IN THE SOUTH, SOUTHEAST,

00:10:21.687 --> 00:10:25.391 line:0%
THE PEOPLE IN THE SOUTH, ALL

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:25.691 line:0%
YOU HEAR ABOUT THE ETHNICITIES

00:10:25.558 --> 00:10:32.598 line:0%
--

00:10:25.858 --> 00:10:35.468 line:0%
RELIGION, CONNECTION, IS A

00:10:32.765 --> 00:10:35.935 line:0%
CONSPIRACY TO KEEP NIGERIA

00:10:35.635 --> 00:10:38.704 line:0%
UNDEVELOPED.

